{
  "id": "w9e",
  "title": "W9e Mac references: Change Space Icon…'s picker",
  "about": "The Windows side is helix/W9e-space-icon (#390, merged). Kite for Mac from origin/main once it has the sidebar test hooks (#412, the capture script's SIDEBAR_FLOOR): KITE_TEST_ICON_PICKER=name opens Change Space Icon…'s picker for that space through requestIconPicker (the space menu's path), on the tab its icon came from, and the in-process capture draws the open popover. Nothing is clicked, typed or activated.",
